  "description": "A necromancer is a profession considered the noble of nobles, with less than 1,000 in the population worldwide! I was born with a diamond spoon, no, a necromancer spoon in my mouth! ...Or so I thought.\n\n*\"I'm just a defective necromancer.\"*\n\n\\[Using skill, \"Summon Ordinary Skeleton\" (E-rank).\\]\n\nYou'd think a necromancer should be able to summon liches, Dullahans, or death knights. But nope, I can only summon skeletons. But then one day, suddenly...\n\n\\[Hidden condition achieved!\\]\n\\[Condition: The 10,000 Uses Rule\\]\n\\[Your rank has upgraded to D-rank!\\]\n\nI achieved the hidden condition and gained the ability to raise my skeletons. From E-rank to S-rank! The story of Joo Donghoon unfolds, the world's only cursed necromancer, who's speeding toward becoming a ranker!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
